Prepare sound captions for Deaf and hard-of-hearing viewers. Listen first. The reference and plot below are CONTEXT, not proof of sound. Report audible observations separately from reference-only facts and visible facts. If silent, state silence even if the reference suggests an event. Do not invent sounds from visible action or plot. Do not assign unverified acoustic adjectives. Return JSON {audible_observations:[],reference_only:[],visible_facts:[],essential,balanced,detailed,uncertain:[]}. Preserve only sound events you can support; levels should add evidence-backed detail, not just punctuation. Captions <=100 characters. Target only the stated interval; surrounding seconds provide context.
Plot context (paraphrased from Blender's official description at https://studio.blender.org/projects/big-buck-bunny/): A large rabbit is bullied by small forest creatures and eventually fights back. Plot does not establish any sound.
